Tool Name: delegate_work_to_coworker
Tool Arguments: {
  "properties": {
    "task": {
      "description": "The task to delegate",
      "title": "Task",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "context": {
      "description": "The context for the task",
      "title": "Context",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "coworker": {
      "description": "The role/name of the coworker to delegate to",
      "title": "Coworker",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "task",
    "context",
    "coworker"
  ],
  "title": "DelegateWorkToolSchema",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false
}
Tool Description: Delegate a specific task to one of the following coworkers: Commit Collector, Release Notes Writer
The input to this tool should be the coworker, the task you want them to do, and ALL necessary context to execute the task, they know nothing about the task, so share absolutely everything you know, don't reference things but instead explain them.
